        OTHERWISE JUST (`the Member State organises specific awareness raising activities on the application of this Regulation tailored to the needs of SMEs including start-ups and deployers` AND `the Member State organises specific training activities on the application of this Regulation tailored to the needs of SMEs including start-ups and deployers`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "organise specific awareness raising and training activities on the application of this Regulation tailored to the needs of SMEs including start-ups, deployers"

