    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`Art 57 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`) THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter VI and Chapter VIII (group General) apply from the date Art 113 gives
        IF NOT (`the enterprise is a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC`) THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the SME providers, including start-ups"
        OTHERWISE JUST (`the specific interests and needs of the SME providers, including start-ups, are taken into account when setting the fees for conformity assessment under Article 43` AND `the fees are reduced proportionately to their size, market size and other relevant indicators`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The specific interests and needs of the SME providers, including start-ups, shall be taken into account when setting the fees for conformity assessment under Article 43, reducing those fees proportionately to their size, market size and other relevant indicators"

