§ `Article 63: derogations for specific operators (paragraph 1 replaced by the Omnibus)`

-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1568 | 1. Microenterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC may comply with certain elements of the quality management system required by Article 17 of this Regulation in a simplified manner, provided that they do not have partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of that Recommendation. For that purpose, the Commission shall develop guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner considering the needs of microenterprises, without affecting the level of protection or the need for compliance with the requirements in respect of high-risk AI systems.
@ref Art 63(1) first sentence as enacted (src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1568)
GIVEN `the enterprise is a microenterprise within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of that Recommendation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 63(1) as enacted the microenterprise may comply with certain elements of the quality management system in a simplified manner` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the enterprise is a microenterprise within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC` AND `the enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of that Recommendation` THEN JUST TRUE  -- the grant: "Microenterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC may comply with certain elements of the quality management system required by Article 17 of this Regulation in a simplified manner, provided that they do not have partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of that Recommendation"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the case falls outside what the grant names

-- src:995 | 1. SMEs, including start-ups, may comply with certain elements of the quality management system required by Article 17 in a simplified manner, provided that they do not have partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC. For that purpose, the Commission shall develop guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner considering the needs of SMEs, without affecting the level of protection or the need for compliance with the requirements in respect of high-risk AI systems.
@ref Art 63(1) first sentence as amended (src:995)
GIVEN `the enterprise is a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 63(1) as amended the SME may comply with certain elements of the quality management system in a simplified manner` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the enterprise is a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC` AND `the enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC` THEN JUST TRUE  -- the grant: "SMEs, including start-ups, may comply with certain elements of the quality management system required by Article 17 in a simplified manner, provided that they do not have partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the case falls outside what the grant names

@ref Art 63(1) first sentence (dispatcher: gate, then the version in force; src:995)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the enterprise is a microenterprise within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the enterprise is a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 63(1) the enterprise may comply with certain elements of the quality management system in a simplified manner` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 57 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter VI and Chapter VIII (group General) apply from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN `Art 63(1) as enacted the microenterprise may comply with certain elements of the quality management system in a simplified manner` `the enterprise is a microenterprise within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC` `the enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC`  -- VERSION as enacted
         WHEN `as amended` THEN `Art 63(1) as amended the SME may comply with certain elements of the quality management system in a simplified manner` `the enterprise is a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC` `the enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC`  -- VERSION as amended

